Correcting a foreign lot cost restores report values.

========== API ==========

unrealizedGains()

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity USD
  format 1,000.00 USD
commodity STOCK
  format 1,000 STOCK
account Assets:Stock
account Assets:USD
account Assets:Cash
P 2024-01-01 STOCK 30 SEK
P 2024-01-01 USD 2 SEK

2024-01-01 Buy dollars
  Assets:USD  10 USD {2 SEK}
  Assets:Cash  -20 SEK

2024-01-01 Buy shares
  Assets:Stock  1 STOCK {20 SEK}
  Assets:USD  -10 USD {2 SEK} @ 2 SEK

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "account": "Assets:Stock",
    "quantity": "10",
    "commodity": "SEK"
  }
]
